<%# One morning composition failed on. It keeps its place in the list
    permanently and says so where the number goes — an edition missing with
    nothing in its place is indistinguishable from a morning nothing arrived
    on, and the reader has no way to tell those apart.

    Not a link, and it wears the same shape as a row that is: the list reads
    as one column of days either way, and the date drops to the body ink so a
    reader scanning down can see there is nothing behind it. %>
<li class="archive__row">
  <div class="archive__link archive__link--absent">
    <span class="archive__number"><%= gap_row.number %></span>
    <span class="archive__date"><%= gap_row.date %></span>
  </div>
</li>
